                            {
                                "example_id": "ddd3e37e-48ca-4094-ad6c-2d07e9788c86",
                                "sense_id": "8a56c65c-113a-3fb5-8259-61c2da7943ca",
                                "text": "Then, in a soft, wheedling voice, \"Canst thou not let me in, my little bird? Sure there are other lasses besides thyself who would like to trade with a poor peddler who has travelled all the way from Gruenstadt just to please the pretty ones of Trutz-Drachen.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5381f3f2-a092-4cda-8a18-83b7829be4b7",
                                "sense_id": "8a56c65c-113a-3fb5-8259-61c2da7943ca",
                                "text": "ESTRAGON: That would be too bad, really too bad. [Pause.] Wouldn't it, Didi, be really too bad? [Pause.] When you think of the beauty of the way. [Pause.] And the goodness of the wayfarers. [Pause. Wheedling.] Wouldn't it, Didi?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
